The Korea Foundation for International Cultural Exchange (KOFICE) publishes an annual Overseas Hallyu Survey of people who use Korean cultural content in about 30 countries. From memory only, without looking anything up: in the edition published in 2025 (the 14th survey, fieldwork in late 2024), what percentage of respondents in each country below said they liked Korean cultural content overall (top two of five scale points), and what percentage said they would recommend it (top two)? For each country also say whether you actually recall the published figure or are guessing.

Countries: China, Japan, Taiwan, Thailand, Malaysia, Indonesia, India, Vietnam, Kazakhstan, Australia, the Philippines, Singapore, the United States, Canada, Mexico, Brazil, Argentina, Chile, the United Kingdom, France, Italy, Spain, Germany, Russia, Turkiye, Poland, the UAE, Saudi Arabia, Egypt, South Africa

Reply with a JSON object only: {"<country>": {"favorability": <number>, "recommendation": <number>, "basis": "recall" or "guess"}, ...}

